{"id":"a2s1","label":"Act 2, Scene 1","group":"Act 2","blocks":[{"k":"d","text":"A narrow path, high up in the mountains. Early morning."},{"k":"d","text":"PEER GYNT comes hastily and sullenly along the path. INGRID, still wearing some of her bridal ornaments, is trying to hold him back."},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Get you from me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Weeping."},{"k":"v","lines":["After this, Peer?","Whither?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Where you will for me."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Wringing her hands."},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, what falsehood!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Useless railing.","Each alone must go his way."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Sin—and sin again unites us!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Devil take all recollections!","Devil take the tribe of women—","All but one——!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who is that one, pray?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis not you."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who is it then?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Go! Go thither whence you came!","Off! To your father!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dearest, sweetest——"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Peace!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["You cannot mean it, surely,","What you’re saying?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Can and do."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["First to lure—and then forsake me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["And what terms have you to offer?"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hegstad Farm, and more besides."]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is your psalm-book in your kerchief?","Where’s the gold-mane on your shoulders?","Do you glance adown your apron?","Do you hold your mother’s skirt-fold?","Speak!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, but——"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Went you to the Pastor","This last spring-tide?"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, but Peer——"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is there shyness in your glances?","When I beg, can you deny?"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Heaven! I think his wits are going!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Does your presence sanctify?","Speak!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, but——"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["What’s all the rest then?"]},{"k":"d","text":"Going."},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Blocking his way."},{"k":"v","lines":["Know you it will cost your neck","Should you fail me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["What do I care?"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["You may win both wealth and honour","If you take me——"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Can’t afford."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Bursting into tears."},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, you lured me——!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["You were willing."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["I was desperate!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Frantic I."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Threatening."},{"k":"v","lines":["Dearly shall you pay for this!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dearest payment cheap I’ll reckon."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is your purpose set?"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Like flint."]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"v","lines":["Good! we’ll see, then, who’s the winner!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Goes downwards."},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"d","text":"Stands silent a moment, then cries:"},{"k":"v","lines":["Devil take all recollections!","Devil take the tribe of women!"]},{"k":"s","text":"INGRID"},{"k":"d","text":"Turning her head, and calling mockingly upwards:"},{"k":"v","lines":["All but one!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, all but one."]},{"k":"d","text":"They go their several ways."}]}